OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Sally
OL,6,G     Beamish
OL,7,     F1/5. Donald Macleod joins Sally
OL,8,     FBeamish at her home on the South
OL,9,     FCoast of England to explore her
OL,10,     Fmusical upbringing.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FPetroc Trelawny talks to Marin
OL,13,     FAlsop ahead of tonight's Prom, and
OL,14,     Fwith director Kate Fahy about new
OL,15,     Fplay - Holy Fool - about
OL,16,     FShostakovich's struggles with
OL,17,     FStalin's regime.
